Ideal Theaters</span></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
&nbsp;</h1>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-ly5vbtw0":{"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-ly5vbtw0","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"columnOverrides":{"width":"100%","contentArea":{"alignment":0.5,"width":588}},"translations":{"ariaLabel":"content changes on hover"}},"comp-ly5vbtw23":{"html":"<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;">Experience Hollywood blockbusters the way movies were meant to be seen&mdash;on the big screen at one of our two beautifully restored historic theaters on Main Street in Heber City, Utah.</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;"><span class="wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;">The Avon Theatre (est. 1948) is America&rsquo;s favorite indoor &ldquo;drive-in&rdquo; movie theater, known for its nostalgic charm and immersive sound. (Surround Sound was actually invented there!) The Ideal Theatre (est. 1914) offers a classic movie-palace atmosphere with a full proscenium and stage&mdash;evoking the elegance of Hollywood&rsquo;s Golden Age.</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;">Beyond first-run films, we host a variety of themed Movie Clubs at both theaters, including book and a movie club, musical sing-alongs, westerns, interactive cinema, sports films, kids and family favorites, international films, nature features, and more. If there&rsquo;s a series you&rsquo;d like to learn about&mdash;or one you&rsquo;d love to see&mdash;reach out and let us know.</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;"><span class="wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;">Our theaters are also available for private rentals, including birthday parties, family reunions, meetings, video-game parties, and even wedding receptions (yes&mdash;we&rsquo;ve hosted those, too!).</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;"><span class="wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;">Our goal is simple: to be your home away from home&mdash;a welcoming gathering place where friends and families come together, are greeted with a smile, and create lasting memories. A place to meet each weekend and enjoy movies the way we used to&mdash;on a giant screen, with incredible sound, and great snacks.</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;">For showtime information and locations, please check our website.<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
To speak with someone or leave a message, please call our box office at (435) 776-5177.</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;"><span class="wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;">Avon Theatre: 94 S. Main Street</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;">Ideal Theatre: 113 N. Main Street</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:14px;">Heber City, Utah</p>

